title: "LEAP-GR: predicting link breaks in UAV swarms"
abstract: >-
  Loss attribution for seven FANET routing protocols on UavNetSim-v1, and LEAP-GR, a greedy geographic
  routing protocol that switches next hop when the link to Greedy's choice is predicted to break.
